999
Woody controller body rev A - Oak top (oak_top)
999
Material: hardwood, the owner's choice (the parts are named oak); stained a very dark ebony, the grain still showing, under a satin oil finish
999
Thickness: 6 mm (the flush rule: switch.keycap_top_above_seat - switch.total_travel)
999
Quantity per instrument: 1
999
Units mm. Cut every closed outline. cad 3f3b9b903ea0; verify: python3 tools/cad.py explain fab-dxf-oak-top-pockets
